<section class="section surface"><div class="container editorial-reading"><span class="eyebrow">A useful rhythm</span><h2>Read. Try something small. Return to the evidence.</h2><ol class="editorial-steps"><li>Read a chapter or watch a published video with its transcript.</li><li>Write down one question it raises for your own situation.</li><li>Choose a bounded test and decide what would change your mind.</li><li>Record what happened, including limitations and the next decision.</li></ol><p>The weekly series is a publishing intention; only released chapters and actual observations appear on the site. A blank worksheet is a starting point, not proof that a business will work.</p><div class="editorial-actions"><a class="button" href="<?=e(url('/newsletter'))?>" data-analytics-event="newsletter_signup_open" data-content-id="weekly-updates">Receive the next update →</a><a class="text-link" href="<?=e(url('/watch'))?>">Browse videos →</a><a class="text-link" href="<?=e(url('/about'))?>">About the writer →</a></div></div></section>

